{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "每个歌手都有属于自己的代表作  (Every Singer Has Her Own Signature Song)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the Twelve Singers stage for Episode Two, newcomer Bai Yang prepares to debut the songwriter's gifted new piece and shyly asks mentor Xin Huimei to sing alongside her one more time. Listen to Wen Simo, Xin Huimei, and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎回来！按照规则，我们终于迎来了在上一场排名第一的辛惠美战队的外卡歌手，有请白杨！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么，上一场的二重唱还没热闹够呢？还是要问一下导师的意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我拒绝和白杨再次同台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "全世界的人都在议论说白杨的声音和某个人很像，其实我并不这么认为。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得白杨的声音非常特别。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "白杨，你不用模仿任何人，也不必模仿我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "乔木这首歌非常充满东方风味，我觉得这是上天赐给你不二的选择。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是不会给你抢戏的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "每个歌手都有属于自己的代表作，我觉得乔木就是你的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在就需要问一下台下的这位绅士，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "作为版权的所有者，你愿意相信我的这位学员吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "乔木的演唱权，永久授权给白杨！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎回来！按照规则，我们终于迎来了在上一场排名第一的辛惠美战队的外卡歌手，有请白杨！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome back! Under our rules, please welcome the wild-card singer from first-place Team Xin Huimei — Bai Yang!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么，上一场的二重唱还没热闹够呢？还是要问一下导师的意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's this — wasn't last week's duet lively enough? Let's hear what your mentor thinks first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我拒绝和白杨再次同台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I refuse to share the stage with Bai Yang a second time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "全世界的人都在议论说白杨的声音和某个人很像，其实我并不这么认为。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone out there is gossiping that Bai Yang's voice sounds just like someone else's, yet I don't see it that way at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得白杨的声音非常特别。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think Bai Yang's voice is remarkably distinctive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "白杨，你不用模仿任何人，也不必模仿我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bai Yang, you don't need to imitate anyone — and you certainly don't need to imitate me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "乔木这首歌非常充满东方风味，我觉得这是上天赐给你不二的选择。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This song Arbor brims with Eastern poetic charm; I believe it is a match made in heaven for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是不会给你抢戏的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I refuse to steal any of your spotlight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "每个歌手都有属于自己的代表作，我觉得乔木就是你的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every singer deserves a signature song of her very own, and I believe Arbor is yours!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在就需要问一下台下的这位绅士，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now we just need to ask the gentleman seated below the stage — Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "作为版权的所有者，你愿意相信我的这位学员吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As the copyright holder, are you willing to place your trust in my student?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "乔木的演唱权，永久授权给白杨！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The performance rights to Arbor are hereby granted permanently to Bai Yang!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎回来！按照规则，我们终于迎来了在上一场排名第一的辛惠美战队的外卡歌手，有请白杨！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么，上一场的二重唱还没热闹够呢？还是要问一下导师的意见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我拒绝和白杨再次同台。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "全世界的人都在议论说白杨的声音和某个人很像，其实我并不这么认为。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得白杨的声音非常特别。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "白杨，你不用模仿任何人，也不必模仿我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "乔木这首歌非常充满东方风味，我觉得这是上天赐给你不二的选择。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是不会给你抢戏的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "每个歌手都有属于自己的代表作，我觉得乔木就是你的！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在就需要问一下台下的这位绅士，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "作为版权的所有者，你愿意相信我的这位学员吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "乔木的演唱权，永久授权给白杨！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping back graciously so Bai Yang won't imitate anyone or share the spotlight, Xin Huimei invites Chun Yuqiao onstage—where he grants Bai Yang permanent performance rights to her own signature song. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
